   "why": "S81U-SVCX3 10-17: gate 2 default H-tree (32/44 clusters, 8 levels to 17 um regions, 11 BUFx24/path) gave TT 401..543 ps, a 207-flop SW-corner gather pin-flop group hung on 150 um return wires from far taps (+120 ps). Measured on the gate-2 placement (re-CTS, TT, placement RC): this setting 329..401 ps (spread 72), no corner outliers; default 401..546; unclustered 437..535 / dbb>=80 unclustered diverges. Kept unchanged for the half-row leaf (S81U-SVCX4). S81U-SVCX4 10-17 half-row gate 1 (a069ef9ef, 7,310 sinks): gate-3 setting TT 177.8..293.3 ps (spread 115.5); 18-variant re-CTS sweep on its 3_place.odb (TT, placement RC): unbalance 0.5 + buffer every 100 um = 207.0..261.4 ps (spread 54.5); 0.5/80 266.8 max / 73.4; 0.5/120 63.0; default levels 244..305; 0.8 variants 82..154 spread."
