 "structural_change": "S81U-SVCX4 (clock rule): the one-row centre leaf dsdv_svc_sx_row (14.4k sinks, 388.8 sq) measured TT 326..415 ps / 89 ps spread at its best CTS (gate 3), over 300/80; the leaf is now HALF a row (head-parity half: 8 qaddf + gather/scatter crossbars, ~7.3k sinks, 216 sq at <= 5.3 pins/um), 8 per slice, hardened once (strap hb). Nothing crosses halves (pair nodes no longer shift the scatter; the leaf taps local slot 0 of half head[0]); bit-identical, zero added cycles, 5-cycle hop kept; dsdv_svc_sx ports unchanged.",
